Day 5: Network Discovery with Nmap

Project Overview
This lab focused on performing network discovery within the home lab environment using Nmap. The objective was to identify active hosts, examine network services, and gain a deeper understanding of how cybersecurity professionals gather information about systems on a network.

Environment

Component	Technology
Host Operating System	Windows
Virtualization Software	VirtualBox
Attacker Machine	Kali Linux
Target Machine	Windows Virtual Machine
Network Tool	Nmap

Objectives

Verify communication between Kali Linux and Windows
Identify the target system's IP address
Perform network discovery
Investigate open ports
Identify available services
Document findings

Tasks Completed

Identified the Windows virtual machine IP address
Verified connectivity between lab systems
Performed an Nmap scan
Investigated open ports
Performed service detection
Recorded observations and findings

